  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in \"T\u0131ls\u0131m \u0130kilisi\" kart\u0131n\u0131
    se\xE7tin.\n\nBir \u015Feyler i\xE7in \xE7ok \xE7aba harcam\u0131\u015F fakat
    a\u015Fman gereken her yoku\u015Fta bolca patinaj \xE7ekmi\u015Fsin {{isim}}.
    Verdi\u011Fin emeklere ra\u011Fmen hayat, d\xF6n\xFCp dola\u015F\u0131p seni
    hep ayn\u0131 noktaya getirmi\u015F. Maddi a\xE7\u0131dan rahat oldu\u011Fun
    d\xF6nemlerde tad\u0131n yokmu\u015F, keyfin yerinde oldu\u011Fu zamanlarda ise
    paran... Kendini hep bir \"dengeleme\" \xE7abas\u0131yla ge\xE7irmi\u015Fsin
    y\u0131llar\u0131n\u0131. Al\u0131\u015Fveri\u015F yapmakta, uyumakta, d\xFC\u015F\xFCnmekte,
    k\u0131sa y\xFCr\xFCy\xFC\u015Flerde ya da dizi ve film izlemekte bulmu\u015Fsun
    teselliyi. Eline ge\xE7en her ne varsa \xE7abucak t\xFCkenmi\u015F. Bereketini
    g\xF6rememi\u015F, hakk\u0131yla istifade edememi\u015Fsin."
